      "q_source": "stage2_test_predictions.csv",
      "step_number": 2,
      "text": "Step 2: Using the midpoint formula, we have:\n\\[\n\\left( \\frac{x + x'}{2}, \\frac{y + y'}{2} \\right) = (4, 1)\n\\]\nThis gives us two equations:\n\\[\n\\frac{x + x'}{2} = 4 \\quad \\text{and} \\quad \\frac{y + y'}{2} = 1\n\\]\nSolving these, we get:\n\\[\nx + x' = 8 \\quad \\Rightarrow \\quad x' = 8 - x\n\\]\n\\[\ny + y' = 2 \\quad \\Rightarrow \\quad y' = 2 - y\n\\]",
